or scheme of some of your pieces!\n\nPlease consider drawing my character, Poppy! https://toyhou.se/20506451.poppy\n\nPoppy is a shapeshifting mimic monster that eats others of her kind, so while it might look like she eats humans, that's actually not the case! She typically disguises herself as a high-school girl but she also has a history of dressing extravagantly in her long past! She likes red and red things. She also has a \"cool beauty\" vibe as a human.\n\nIf you feel like it, you may draw other shapeshifting mimic monsters in the picture as well if you'd like to add to a creepy atmosphere but that's definitely up to you! And I would love either version of Poppy, whichever you feel like or that inspires you more!\n\nI trust your compositions so please draw freely!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/20506451.poppy", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@25dPz/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/60239368/uploads/origins/dca9341d-3092-48d5-a2aa-bdb737062143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8e80a5268e9ad4c7ecff84ba8c17d9a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/60239368/uploads/origins/dca9341d-3092-48d5-a2aa-bdb737062143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8e80a5268e9ad4c7ecff84ba8c17d9a, https://si.imgix.net/60239368/uploads/origins/dca9341d-3092-48d5-a2aa-bdb737062143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87f1c9cf795cc9e48cc44bdf584ec1c2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/60239368/uploads/origins/dca9341d-3092-48d5-a2aa-bdb737062143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a10dfddedeaa74db571a5383010e5b0e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! The way you color and shade is very unique and pleasant to look at, especially when using darker colors! Could I trouble you to draw my caprine demon girl, Furcifer? I give you full freedom over the pose and composition, but she is a pretty generic 'your soul for my wishes' demon.\n\nExcuse the subpar reference materials, she hasn't been fully drawn yet! However, the references contain almost everything in her design. Thank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/OIOq8Lc", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@25dPz/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eaffa83f/uploads/origins/ed28e3c5-f9c0-4e33-9a61-a57d799d3359?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b123da3ad2170c0585e29096f2793973", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eaffa83f/uploads/origins/ed28e3c5-f9c0-4e33-9a61-a57d799d3359?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b123da3ad2170c0585e29096f2793973, https://si.imgix.net/eaffa83f/uploads/origins/ed28e3c5-f9c0-4e33-9a61-a57d799d3359?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0260beb0dd9e1f2fe4e71f8626e761f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eaffa83f/uploads/origins/ed28e3c5-f9c0-4e33-9a61-a57d799d3359?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82b8e771da7bfa2e4066cf9ab2e97b8d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I love mera's drawings! I would like to make a request!\n\nI am a cute and mischievous exorcist.\nShe is petite at 153cm. Her breasts are very flat!\nShe often makes a smug and mischievous face.\nPlease draw her wearing glasses.\n\nI want her to be cute and a little creepy!\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1IBj9Z7T0MaTXUGD1kUWdhY1H8CW8xoQC?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@25dPz/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5207c453/uploads/origins/2ecc257b-c150-42de-a5de-0a127f876d9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47fde01d9ac864be5b695554ab190914", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5207c453/uploads/origins/2ecc257b-c150-42de-a5de-0a127f876d9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=