de his compassionate center under a cold exterior. he holds himself to a high standard & exudes nobility from posture, vocabulary & fighting style.\n\nplease feel free to draw him as you'd like! his helmet can be worn on or off & you can include his weapons if you wish. my friend has provided a lot of references!\n\nthank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FTBwiD16OmRuc5hm4muwzPyL3aIhKY5S", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@25dPz/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/68b2de8c/uploads/origins/9981b150-9be7-4bf7-9245-f9298da375a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0669054dd8909c20af339f327626e4b9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/68b2de8c/uploads/origins/9981b150-9be7-4bf7-9245-f9298da375a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0669054dd8909c20af339f327626e4b9, https://si.imgix.net/68b2de8c/uploads/origins/9981b150-9be7-4bf7-9245-f9298da375a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=598a49b835d302cfcbea78b80e3aedb6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/68b2de8c/uploads/origins/9981b150-9be7-4bf7-9245-f9298da375a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e122e238abeddafd98a253d33b909cf0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Mera!  I really like the way you paint and shade, your art is unique!  I’d like to request you draw my character Benny.\nHe is an astronaut boy who had his body taken by an Alien.\nYou can draw him however you like!\nIf you’d want to know a little more of his lore, there is a paragraph in the link.\nThank you for to consideration!\n-Thu\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/23916334.astronaut-guy#72177872", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@25dPz/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3bc2ce27/uploads/origins/86e7b958-33ec-4cfb-9a6e-a67debe8eb04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f224195d0145d3efae